{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1457180-human-resonance-conduits","id":1457180,"title":"Human Resonance Conduits","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-08-18T22:04:32-07:00","id":1457180,"title":"Human Resonance Conduits","content":"I have a Technocracy plot where genetically engineered humans are used to transmit the Resonance of a Horizon Construct to sleepers who they have intimate relationships with, both though physical contact and private conversation where the conduit shares ideas supporting the Construct's<br /> philosophy. They describe their ideal paradise and their lover has happy dreams about Construct.<br /> <br /> Is this Sphere combination correct?<br /> Dimensional Science 5, Correspondence 3, Life 3, Prime 2, Mind 3.<br /> <br /> Can the recipient become a conduit without ever visiting the Construct, effecting someone else in the same way - a chain reaction -<br /> if there is an appropriate amount of time spent together by conduit and recipient (I'm thinking six months)?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-19T03:30:55-07:00","id":1457197,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HorizonParty2021</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1457180-human-resonance-conduits#post1457180\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> I have a Technocracy plot where genetically engineered humans are used to transmit the Resonance of a Horizon Construct to sleepers who they have intimate relationships with, both though physical contact and private conversation where the conduit shares ideas supporting the Construct's philosophy. They describe their ideal paradise and their lover has happy dreams about Construct.</div> </div> </div> </div>Does this work for lovers only, or also for close friends?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HorizonParty2021</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1457180-human-resonance-conduits#post1457180\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is this Sphere combination correct?<br /> Dimensional Science 5, Correspondence 3, Life 3, Prime 2, Mind 3.</div> </div> </div> </div>Mind 3 Prime 2 Life 3 seems to be correct. Consider the possibility of it being Mind 3-4, with Mind 4 leading to more profound and intricate dreams.<br /> What is the Dimensional Science 5 for? Manipulation of Resonance? Wouldn't this be Prime?<br /> Correspondence seems to be not needed considering the Effect is anchored on the agents of the Technocracy. Unless it is the case that the dreams are created on an ongoing basis.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HorizonParty2021</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1457180-human-resonance-conduits#post1457180\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Can the recipient become a conduit without ever visiting the Construct, effecting someone else in the same way - a chain reaction -<br /> if there is an appropriate amount of time spent together by conduit and recipient (I'm thinking six months)?</div> </div> </div> </div>I would say Correspondence 3 would be needed to link to the person becoming a conduit and establish this Effect. Or Prime 4 on the initial agent of the Technocracy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3254-muad-dib","name":"Muad'Dib","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3254_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2059"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-19T12:43:35-07:00","id":1457223,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Muad'Dib</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1457180-human-resonance-conduits?p=1457197#post1457197\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Does this work for lovers only, or also for close friends?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think it would not work for friends. There is an aspect that is in the mind, but human are a Life Pattern. If you want Resonance to flow from one Life Pattern and soak into another, I would think that it has to involve Life, Prime and very close physical contact. If the friends are on a wrestling team and it's a Chantry dedicated to ancient Greek athletic tradition, I suppose.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Muad'Dib</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1457180-human-resonance-conduits?p=1457197#post1457197\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mind 3 Prime 2 Life 3 seems to be correct. Consider the possibility of it being Mind 3-4, with Mind 4 leading to more profound and intricate dreams.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sounds good. I will also have behavioral changes, like recipient redecorating their living space to resemble the Construct in their dream. Since it's a couple doing this, other Magick can be cast to transform the living space coincidentally. The recipient just assumes the conduit went shopping and added things as a surprise.<br /> <br /> In the Ascension War, Mind 4 is the ultimate weapon for simply conscripting your enemies.<br /> <br /> \u200b<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Muad'Dib</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1457180-human-resonance-conduits?p=1457197#post1457197\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What is the Dimensional Science 5 for? Manipulation of Resonance? Wouldn't this be Prime?</div> </div> </div> </div>The Resonance is being channeled from a Construct in the Horizon. DS to facilitate flow from there to Earth, Prime to handle the Resonance itself.<br /> <br /> \u200b<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Muad'Dib</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1457180-human-resonance-conduits?p=1457197#post1457197\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Correspondence seems to be not needed considering the Effect is anchored on the agents of the Technocracy. Unless it is the case that the dreams are created on an ongoing basis.</div> </div> </div> </div>Same as for DS, except Correspondence is used to get it from the closest Earthly connection to the Construct, to the conduit, who then bleeds it onto the recipient through close contact (Because they are an active participant from the beginning, the difficulty is less to establish the effect than if the effect skipped the conduit entirely. Less quint expenditure to reduce difficulty). They are usually sleeping beside the recipient when they are dreaming, relaxing the body and creating an association between the recipient's feelings for the conduit and the newfound realm in their dreams.<br /> <br /> <br /> \u200b<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Muad'Dib</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1457180-human-resonance-conduits?p=1457197#post1457197\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would say Correspondence 3 would be needed to link to the person becoming a conduit and establish this Effect. Or Prime 4 on the initial agent of the Technocracy.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200b<br /> Right, Prime 4, both infuse and expel - well, resonance, not quintessence. I think the same rating would apply for both. I overlooked that in the entry.<br /> <br /> When the effect is first cast, the recipient would likely be in the Horizon Construct, sitting in a chair in a medical lab with all the Technocratic machines needed for casters to focus the effect. The conduit is a willing participant who is right in front of the casters. This is to make the effect less difficult before expending quintessence. Afterward, conduit takes the space-elevator to Earth, gets on dating apps and hits the club, looking for that influential or important Sleeper. The flow to the recipient begins after they go home together.<br /> <br /> It is a continuous flow, rather than charge/discharge (like a wire carrying electricity, not a pen with replaceable ink cartridges). The amount of Resonance present in the Construct is much larger than what a human Life Pattern can hold, so the discharge from the Construct, through the conduit and into the recipient happens faster, though the casters would adjust resistance to avoid killing either person. Both Prime and Correspondence are need to establish and continue the effect.<br /> <br /> Edit: Pertaining to the question of a chain reaction being possible - if it were, I think it would simply be a mater of reducing the safety-resistance as new recipients join the chain. This could be as simple as using DS and Prime to tighten the Gauntlet around a cable that is a Focus when the effect is cast and then loosening it to allow faster flow to more recipients. Also why I think Corr3, not 2, so it could become a multitarget branching effect. <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":26467,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","user":"HorizonParty2021","date":". 08-19-2021, 04:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-28T21:50:46-07:00","id":1457953,"title":"","content":"Mind 3, Prime 2, Life 3 is your starting point. This will establish your Conduit.<br /> <br /> If you increase Prime to 4, you'll basically be infusing the Construct's resonance directly in the Conduit and, using your own analogy, they'll work as a charged pen. The advantage is that the Conduit will be able to make this work in a single target without the risk, lets say, of an RD tracing the connection to the Construct.<br /> <br /> But if you want to go through your original idea, DS 2 and Correspondence 2 are good enough, although you may feel more comfortable with 3. The flow of Resonance is being commanded mainly by the other Spheres, you don't need more than basic transportation.<br /> <br /> Since you have Mind 3 in the effect and want it to take some time you don't need to worry so much about the amount of Resonance. Also, if you put that Correspondence 2/3 on the effect, there is no need for it to only affect lovers unless you want to do so.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}